==Trivia==
*The Wall Breakers are 1 of 19 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] which first existed in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Minions]], [[Archers]], [[Goblins]], [[Skeletons]], [[Barbarians]], [[Giant]], [[Valkyrie]], [[Wizard]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Balloon]], [[Golem]], [[Bowler]], [[Cannon Cart]], [[Phoenix]], [[Lava Hound]], and the [[Archer Queen]].
**The Clash of Clans counterpart targets Walls, hence the name, and has a 40x damage multiplier against them. Unlike the Clash Royale counterpart, the Wall Breaker's damage in Clash of Clans is extremely low and not enough to destroy anything other than Walls. Due to Walls not existing in Clash Royale, they were made to target any [[:Category:Building Cards|building]] instead, with higher base damage but no damage multiplier. Wall Breakers in Clash of Clans also have death damage, which is not the case in Clash Royale.
**The second part of the Wall Breaker's card description is also shared from its Clash of Clans counterpart, with the word "''walls''" replaced by "''buildings''", as "walls" do not exist in Clash Royale.
**The Wall Breakers resemble the Level 6 Wall Breaker from Clash of Clans, although they do not wear an aviator cap.
**According to Clash of Clans, Balloons are "promoted" Wall Breakers.
***It is somewhat ironic to note that Balloon pilots are promoted Wall Breakers, as the latter are kamikaze units and would not be actually "promoted" since they will perish instantly upon attacking.
*The Wall Breakers are 1 of 15 [[cards]] associated with Skeletons, with the others being [[Bomber]], [[Skeleton Dragons]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Tombstone]], [[Bomb Tower]], [[Guards]], [[Skeleton Army]], Witch, Balloon, [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Super Witch]], [[Graveyard]], [[Skeleton King]], and of course, Skeletons.
**It is suggested that Bombers are promoted Wall Breakers, as one of the [[Loading Screen Hints]] says "''One day, Wall Breakers realized that they could do a lot more damage if they THREW the bomb rather than sat beside it. Imagine that...''", implying that Bombers used to be Wall Breakers.
***Their deployment audio is shared with the Bomber, however, once their deployment timer is over, they will make their own battle cry.
***Their attack audio is a slightly sped-up version of Bomber's attack.
*The Wall Breakers are one of the first troop cards to receive a card render, alongside the Archers, [[Knight]], Goblins, Bomber, Skeletons, Barbarians, [[Bats]], [[Royal Recruits]], Skeleton Barrel, [[Rascals]], [[Musketeer]], Giant, Valkyrie, Wizard, [[Flying Machine]], Hog Rider, [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Zappies]], [[Elixir Golem]], [[Baby Dragon]], Skeleton Army, Witch, P.E.K.K.A, [[Prince]], Balloon, Giant Skeleton, [[Goblin Giant]], [[Hunter]], [[Electro Dragon]], Bowler, Cannon Cart, [[Mega Knight]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Miner]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Ice Wizard]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Bandit]], Lava Hound, [[Night Witch]], and [[Fisherman]].
*The Wall Breakers are 1 of 8 troops to die as a part of their attack, the others being the [[Electro Spirit]], [[Fire Spirit]], [[Ice Spirit]], Skeleton Barrel, [[Battle Ram]], [[Heal Spirit]], and [[Suspicious Bush]].
*The Wall Breakers are 1 of 4 troops which can defeat themselves in one attack, the others being Skeletons, Bats and [[Firecracker]]. 
**Unlike the others, the Wall Breakers cannot target other Wall Breakers.
**The Wall Breakers are 1 of 2 troops with more damage than hitpoints, the other being Guards.
*The Wall Breakers, along with [[Barbarian Barrel]], [[Rage]], and [[Goblin Curse]], are the cheapest {{Rarity|Epic}} cards, costing 2 [[Elixir]].
*The Wall Breakers are the only building-targeting troops that inflict area damage with their regular attack.
*In the French, Korean, Arabic, Chinese, Malaysian, Thai, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Wall Breakers' name translates to "Sappers", "Skeleton Assault", "Wall Destroyers", "Siege Bombers", "Fortress Breakers", "Wall Bombers", and "Siege Soldiers" respectively.
*The Wall Breakers have been featured in multiple [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|special game modes]] outside of the card. More specifically:
**The Wall Breakers are 1 of 23 troops that have been featured in the [[Troop Rush]] game [[:Category:Modes|mode]], the others being Skeletons, Skeleton Dragons, Fire Spirit, Bats, [[Elite Barbarians]], Firecracker, Rascal Girls, Royal Hogs, Heal Spirit, Elixir Golem, Guards, Prince, Balloon, Golem, Ram Rider, [[Sparky]], Phoenix, Royal Ghost, Bandit, [[Lumberjack]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], and the [[Monk]].
**The Wall Breakers are 1 of 14 troops that has been featured with a [[Buff#Rage|Rage]] [[buff]], the others being Electro Spirit, Giant, Zappies, Guards, Giant Skeleton, Goblin Giant, Electro Dragon, [[Electro Giant]], Mega Knight, Ram Rider, [[Electro Wizard]], Sparky, and Royal Ghost.
*The Wall Breakers are 1 of 23 cards that has had its Elixir cost changed, the others being Bomber, Fire Spirit, Royal Recruits, [[Cannon]], [[Mortar]], Musketeer, [[Three Musketeers]], [[Heal]], [[Goblin Hut]], Bomb Tower, [[Barbarian Hut]], [[Furnace]], [[Elixir Collector]], Skeleton Army, P.E.K.K.A., Electro Giant, Bowler, [[Goblin Barrel]], Barbarian Barrel, Rage, Fisherman, and the Monk.
*The Wall Breakers, along with the Minions, Bomber, Skeletons, Skeleton Dragons, Ice Spirit, [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]], [[Mega Minion]], [[Ice Golem]], Dart Goblin, Elixir Golem, [[Goblin Cage|Goblin Brawler]], Guards, Baby Dragon, P.E.K.K.A, Giant Skeleton, Golem, Bowler, [[Executioner]], Mega Knight, [[Inferno Dragon]], Royal Ghost, and Lava Hound, are featured as a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Monsters monster] in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
*Before the Wall Breakers' card release, the Wall Breakers were supposed to be a {{Rarity|Legendary}} card. However, they were changed to an {{Rarity|Epic}} card post-release.
*The Wall Breakers are in a relationship according to the [https://x.com/ClashRoyale/status/1964343375223537669/photo/3 Royale High Yearbook].

